  "description": "Radzen Blazor is the most sophisticated free and open-source (MIT, including commercial use, with no license key, app limit or revenue limit) UI component library for Blazor, featuring 155+ native components including DataGrid, Scheduler, Gantt, PivotDataGrid, an Excel-like Spreadsheet with formulas and XLSX import/export, and 30+ chart types drawn in C# as SVG, the most complete AI toolkit for Blazor - AIChat with tool calling, approvals and attachments, AIPrompt, InlineAIPrompt and SmartPasteButton on Microsoft.Extensions.AI, working with any OpenAI-compatible provider - and free Material, Standard, Default, Humanistic and Software themes in light and dark.",
